  "sourceTitle": "Claude Opus 5.5, GPT-6 Sol, GPT-6 Luna, and a new price war",
  "sourceBodyHash": "799e3733b50b3cbf8bdf3b9557a308c25abc0fc6a6306fbd2011cb2dfeacb7cf",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
