  "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-29T04:23:38.154798Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-29T04:37:13.011890Z",
  "totalBlocks": 35,
  "translatedBlocks": 27,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75f3ff84af0a918a",
      "translationZh": "昨天发布了 Grok 4.7（鹈鹕）和 MiMo v2.6 Flash/Pro（更多鹈鹕）。今天 Anthropic 发布了 Claude Opus 5.5，大约一小时后 OpenAI 发布了 GPT-6 Sol 和 GPT-6 Luna。要全面评估这些新模型还需要一段时间，但以下是我目前的初步印象。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f4c9ae5690037096",
      "translationZh": "GPT-6 Sol 和 Luna 的价格是其 GPT-5.6 对应版本的一半",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8cf3f592fba51684",
      "translationZh": "在 0.10/0.50 的情况下，GPT-6 Luna 是 OpenAI 曾经发布的最便宜的模型之一，仅被远弱于它的 GPT-4.1 Nano（0.10/0.40，2025 年 4 月）和 GPT-5 Nano（0.05/0.40，2025 年 8 月）所超越。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1127b441bbefcdd",
      "translationZh": "我为 GPT-6 Luna 和 GPT-6 Sol 渲染了鹈鹕，然后将它们全部组合在这个比较网格中，并加入了 GPT-5.6 鹈鹕。我喜欢你可以立即看到 5.6 系列选择了更大胆、更亮的颜色，而 6 系列则要柔和得多。我仍然认为 GPT-6 Astra 在最大设置下产生了最好的鹈鹕。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "92390dc93b7db126",
      "translationZh": "Claude Opus 5.5 也获得了价格下调。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb394abd546efa8d",
      "translationZh": "Opus 5.5 似乎解决了人们对 Opus 在沟通风格方面的最大抱怨。Thariq Shihipar :",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca197bacf96f1e6e",
      "translationZh": "Opus 5.5 是您反馈的结果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abe1fb0ddd9767a6",
      "translationZh": "它沟通清晰，每个 token 的成本低于 Opus 5.0，具备 Fable 5.1 的智能，非常节省 token，并且在各种努力级别下都能工作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80606b2da1d38080",
      "translationZh": "它也旨在在 Blender 中表现更好。我期待在那里对它进行严格测试。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4c567031a2f91fd",
      "translationZh": "Opus 4.5、4.6、4.7、4.8 和 5 共享相同的价格：输入每百万 token 5，输出每百万 token 25。5.5 降低了 20%——输入每百万 token 4，输出每百万 token 20。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "baa8beac27129580",
      "translationZh": "缓存读取的价格下降了60%。这对较长的代理对话很重要，因为90%以上的输入令牌是在缓存令牌价格下处理的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d04fedf70da7497a",
      "translationZh": "Opus 5.5 的新价格与 GPT-5.6 Sol 的价格相同，但那是在 OpenAI 将其 Sol 价格降低一半之前。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a1977d7520e52d4",
      "translationZh": "GPT-6 Astra 和 Claude Fable 5.1 的价格均为每百万输入 10，每百万输出 50。价格战目前影响的是其下一层级的模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e31cb9d577d213f8",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 表示 Sonnet 5.5 和 Haiku 5.5 即将推出。看看 Haiku 是否能在低端重新获得价格竞争力将很有趣，鉴于当前 Haiku 4.5 的价格是 1/5，而最新的 GPT-6 Luna 价格只有其十分之一，即 0.10/0.50。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a2c8cacd7fdc7895",
      "translationZh": "Claude Opus 5.5 在最大思考级别下过度思考以至于崩溃",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "133e32a9c266d654",
      "translationZh": "在我的 \"生成一个骑自行车的鹈鹕 SVG\" 测试中，这是第一次，Claude Opus 5.5 在 \"max\" 思考级别下未能返回响应！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bd9be5ad6fef02e",
      "translationZh": "它首先将此称为 \"一个经典的测试请求\"，然后对此进行了非常、非常深入的思考：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "961f1a06be15aa5a",
      "translationZh": "这是一个经典的测试请求，所以我想规划出一个构图良好的鹈鹕，具有其独特的喙和囊袋，骑着一辆配有适当车轮、车架和踏板的自行车，背景是简单的天空和地面。[...]",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f8bde590f6ad934",
      "translationZh": "验证小腿长度大约为 95.2，基本符合。现在我在计算从髋部到膝盖再到脚踝的近腿路径，然后勾勒出放在踏板上的脚部形状——用线条和曲线的路径勾勒出脚跟、脚趾尖和鞋底轮廓，使其自然地贴合在 y=478-494 处的踏板表面。[...]",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83c15866331e18b5",
      "translationZh": "我喜欢鱼从篮子里明显突出，鹈鹕正看着它，这是一个值得保留的有趣细节。我也在确认眼睛位置靠近喙基部是否符合鹈鹕的典型解剖结构，并考虑让它表情稍微高兴一些。[...]",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66c9dec30bd99eb1",
      "translationZh": "远腿正确地穿过车架后方，所以我接下来要检查链轮牙齿并确认层次顺序——远端曲柄臂应基本被座管和链轮遮挡。我正在确定最终 SVG 的 width and height attributes 以及 viewBox，以确保正确的缩放，鉴于没有文本，因此不需要 font-family。[...]",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0923b741a1c69f92",
      "translationZh": "我本来很兴奋能看到这只鹈鹕……但然后它停了。Opus 5.5 有 128,000 的 maximum output token limit （其他 Claude models 也是如此），而且它在仍然为 SVG 进行推理时就达到了这个限制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc701309d4c083d2",
      "translationZh": "我第二次尝试并得到了相同的结果。这让我怀疑 \"max\" 基本上是无用的——如果它在一个愚蠢的 SVG 提示上过度思考以至于崩溃，我不相信它不会在更有趣的工作中也这样做。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c37c283dc9143055",
      "translationZh": "(这两次失败每次花费我 2.56，并耗时近 20 分钟。)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5621846aa88671fc",
      "translationZh": "Fable 5.1 在 \"max\" 下没有过度思考，并且给了我迄今为止从任何 Anthropic 模型看到的最佳鹈鹕。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbf163dba683d940",
      "translationZh": "这里是 Opus 5.5 的鹈鹕，不包括 5.5 max。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7da1daa5f0a42614",
      "translationZh": "我还制作了这样一个对比网格，将它们与 Opus 5、Fable 5.1 和 Sonnet 5 生成的鹈鹕进行了比较：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    }
  ],
